Agar poora project Docker Desktop par chalana hai, to ye steps follow karo:

Step 1: Project folder me jao

Tum already ho:

cd "D:\DevOps\AI Adap\AI Best\AI Ada"
Step 2: Containers start karo
docker compose up -d --build
--build code ke latest changes se image rebuild karega.
-d background me run karega.
Step 3: Check karo sab containers up hain
docker ps

Tumhare case me already dikh raha hai:

aiada-frontend-1
aiada-backend-1
mongodb

to ye step pass hai.

Step 4: Backend logs dekho
docker compose logs -f backend

Expected:

MongoDB connected
Server running on port 5000
Step 5: Frontend open karo

Browser me:

http://localhost:3001

Kyuki tumhare frontend container ka port:

0.0.0.0:3001->80

hai.

Step 6: Login/Register

Application me login karo.

Step 7: Goal create karo

Example:

Learn Docker

ya

Learn Kubernetes
Step 8: Learning Path Generate

Button click karo.

Check karo learning path aa raha hai ya nahi.

Step 9: Lesson Generate

Kisi topic par lesson generate karo.

Check karo lesson aa raha hai ya nahi.

Step 10: Quiz Generate

Ab backend logs khule rakho:

docker compose logs -f backend

Phir Quiz Generate button dabao.

Logs me kuch aisa aana chahiye:

🧠 GENERATING QUIZ FOR: Docker Images

🔥 RAW QUIZ RESPONSE:
...
Step 11: Agar quiz nahi aaye

Mujhe backend log ka ye portion bhejna:

🧠 GENERATING QUIZ FOR:

se lekar end tak.

Jab code change karo

Har baar:

docker compose up -d --build

chalana.

Ya force rebuild:

docker compose down
docker compose up -d --build

Abhi tum Step 5 karo:

Browser me

http://localhost:3001

open karo aur batao frontend khul raha hai ya nahi.
